s"}]},{"id":"blk-22933","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-23236","marks":["code"],"text":"schemas/pulse-loop-manifest.v0.1.json"},{"id":"spn-23237","text":" lines 180–191 declare seven boolean invariants. Each is the manifest-level assertion of a box-and-box "},{"id":"spn-23238","marks":["bold"],"text":"alethic Value"},{"id":"spn-23239","text":" invariant family:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-22935","spans":[{"id":"spn-23240","text":"PULSE invariant"}]},{"id":"blk-22936","spans":[{"id":"spn-23241","text":"box-and-box Value family"}]},{"id":"blk-22937","spans":[{"id":"spn-23242","text":"Meaning"}]}],"id":"blk-22934","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-22938","spans":[{"id":"spn-23243","marks":["code"],"text":"phase_atomicity"}]},{"id":"blk-22939","spans":[{"id":"spn-23244","marks":["bold"],"text":"π"},{"id":"spn-23245","text":" (phase ordering)"}]},{"id":"blk-22940","spans":[{"id":"spn-23246","text":"a phase runs to completion or not at all"}]}],[{"id":"blk-22941","spans":[{"id":"spn-23247","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa_routing"}]},{"id":"blk-22942","spans":[{"id":"spn-23248","marks":["bold"],"text":"κ"},{"id":"spn-23249","text":" (cyclicity)"}]},{"id":"blk-22943","spans":[{"id":"spn-23250","text":"route on the κ invariant (OS-002)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-22944","spans":[{"id":"spn-23251","marks":["code"],"text":"feedback_immutability"}]},{"id":"blk-22945","spans":[{"id":"spn-23252","marks":["bold"],"text":"β"},{"id":"spn-23253","text":" (no-overwrite)"}]},{"id":"blk-22946","spans":[{"id":"spn-23254","text":"recorded feedback is never mutated"}]}],[{"id":"blk-22947","spans":[{"id":"spn-23255","marks":["code"],"text":"append_only_audit"}]},{"id":"blk-22948","spans":[{"id":"spn-23256","marks":["bold"],"text":"σ"},{"id":"spn-23257","text":" (provenance)"}]},{"id":"blk-22949","spans":[{"id":"spn-23258","text":"audit is append-only"}]}],[{"id":"blk-22950","spans":[{"id":"spn-23259","marks":["code"],"text":"outcome_grounding"}]},{"id":"blk-22951","spans":[{"id":"spn-23260","marks":["bold"],"text":"σ"},{"id":"spn-23261","text":" (provenance)"}]},{"id":"blk-22952","spans":[{"id":"spn-23262","text":"every outcome traces to a cause"}]}],[{"id":"blk-22953","spans":[{"id":"spn-23263","marks":["code"],"text":"trace_id_propagation"}]},{"id":"blk-22954","spans":[{"id":"spn-23264","marks":["bold"],"text":"σ"},{"id":"spn-23265","text":" (provenance)"}]},{"id":"blk-22955","spans":[{"id":"spn-23266","text":"trace ids flow across phases"}]}],[{"id":"blk-22956","spans":[{"id":"spn-23267","marks":["code"],"text":"quorum_before_commit"}]},{"id":"blk-22957","spans":[{"id":"spn-23268","marks":["bold"],"text":"deontic obligation"},{"id":"spn-23269","text":" (rung 3)"}]},{"id":"blk-22958","spans":[{"id":"spn-23270","text":"an obligation gate, not an alethic fact"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-22959","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-23271","marks":["bold"],"text":"Additive wiring (no schema change):"},{"id":"spn-23272","text":" a conformance checker can lift a manifest's "},{"id":"spn-23273","marks":["code"],"text":"invariants"},{"id":"spn-23274","text":" object into a kernel "},{"id":"spn-23275","marks":["code"],"text":"value"},{"id":"spn-23276","text":" and assert the corresponding Value laws ("},{"id":"spn-23277","marks":["code"],"text":"L1–L14"},{"id":"spn-23278","text":"). The manifest stays declarative; the kernel becomes the "},{"id":"spn-23279","marks":["italic"],"text":"executable"},{"id":"spn-23280","text":" checker. "},{"id":"spn-23281","marks":["code"],"text":"quorum_before_commit"},{"id":"spn-23282","text":" is the one invariant that is genuinely "},{"id":"spn-23283","marks":["bold"],"text":"deontic"},{"id":"spn-23284","text":" (an obligation), not alethic — worth noting in the spec so it is enforced via the norm rung, not as a fact."}]},{"id":"blk-22960","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-23285","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-23286","marks":["code"],"text":"closure.guarantee"},{"id":"spn-23287","text":" ↔ temporal rung (rung 4)"}]},{"id":"blk-22961",